        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1}{10}\\times30=3$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{Rolling 1})&=\\frac1{10}\\\\f&=np\\\\f&=30\\times\\frac1{10}\\\\f&=3\\end{align*}$$\nExpected frequency: 3 rolls of 1.",
