        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac12\\times50=25$",
          "worked": "The odd faces are 1, 3, 5, 7 and 9.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{Rolling odd})&=\\frac5{10}\\\\P(\\text{Rolling odd})&=\\frac12\\\\f&=np\\\\f&=50\\times\\frac12\\\\f&=25\\end{align*}$$\nExpected frequency: 25 rolls of an odd number.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 16
