        "answer": {
          "short": "0",
          "worked": "12 is not a face value, so the event is impossible.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{Rolling 12})&=0\\\\f&=np\\\\f&=100\\times0\\\\f&=0\\end{align*}$$\nExpected frequency: 0 rolls of 12.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
