        "id": "p20-q2-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "Rolling a multiple of 3 (600 trials).",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac3{10}\\times600=180$",
          "worked": "The multiples of 3 are 3, 6 and 9.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{multiple of 3})&=\\frac3{10}\\\\f&=np\\\\f&=600\\times\\frac3{10}\\\\f&=180\\end{align*}$$\nExpected frequency: 180 rolls of a multiple of 3.",
